{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"You enter the tree and are astounded by your surroundings. The inside of the gentle mother is warm and pleasant, and you enter into a room with several chairs and some tea set out.","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:37:15.857000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870525429012889661","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"The Speaker slowly take a seat. The atmosphere around him easing his mind slightly. He sits patiently, waiting for Ferrah or anyone else.","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:39:16.929000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870525936825675796","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Ferrah sits, and you watch as demetrius transforms into a tall bipedal fey with cloudly white-orange eyes and short, slicked back green hair. He is wearing a fine suit that seems to be made out of fine flower petals. ||I find people are more comfortable around me when I am like this, if that is all right|| you hear in your head.","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:44:15.973000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870527191107108894","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"A cup of tea appears on the table next to you.","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:44:29.486000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870527247784771594","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"The Speaker drinks from the cup, his pinky not at all extended as a sign of rebellion against the British. ||'I preferred the stag actually, more majestic. But it is your appearance.'|| He thinks in an attempt to communicate with Demetrius. Another thought pops up, ||'I am here to make a deal for my language and this mismatching armor. I plan on cashing in the favor I recieved from helping you close up the tears.'||","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:47:14.694000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-30T04:49:09.129000Z","id":"870527940717330432","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Demetrius nods. ||Terribly difficult to sit in chairs, however.|| he smiles lightly. ||As for the favor, I am more than happy to accept, though i must be clear: there will still be a cost, potentially great depending on the nature of your situation.||","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:50:52.663000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870528854945595402","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"||'I ask mainly for two things. I wish to replace my knowledge of dragonspeak with knowledge of common. Secondly, I wish for the knowledge of wearing this type of armor,'|| He puts a hand on his platemail. ||'and you can take away knowledge on donning the lighter kind. For those two things do I rescind my favor with the court.'|| The Speaker asks with a lowered head as a sign of humble respect.","created_at":"2021-07-30T04:54:30.821000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870529769966567434","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Demetrius nods slowly. ||Bold requests indeed. Those terms are not quite agreeable, but are close on the surface. Of course, there is very clearly some other magics at work here which may make things more difficult. May i touch your armor to better glean what may be at play?||","created_at":"2021-07-30T05:12:40.721000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870534341338468362","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"The Speaker nods as he thinks. ||'I am not new to the art of deal-making, of course we shall negotiate.'|| He thinks with a smirk as he leans closer to Demetrius to allow him to touch his armor.","created_at":"2021-07-30T05:13:56.936000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870534661007364136","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Demetrius touches the armor before pulling his hand back. ||I see. This is powerful, indeed. I apologize, but this will take a greater offer from you in regards to the armor.||","created_at":"2021-07-30T05:20:52.992000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870536406072688641","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
