{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Pandamaster_0","id":"292531828592738304","is_bot":0,"username":"pandamaster_1"},"author_id":"292531828592738304","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"well, a few days ago\" he sighs deeply \"i was home.. in the Feywild. and i do not know how, but suddenly i found myself here, my form changed, my family and home gone\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T21:56:25.018000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870786940348289035","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Pandamaster_0","id":"292531828592738304","is_bot":0,"username":"pandamaster_1"},"author_id":"292531828592738304","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"im sorry i've been quite unformal\" he interupts himself and bows deeply \"The name is Rax P for short, A pleasure to be in this area and meet such a person\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T21:59:25.887000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870787698967851008","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"The stag nods. ||A pleasure. As for your situation, I am not sure I can provide good news, but maybe the beginnings of an explanation. Last week, the redcoats began tampering with the leylines running under this city which are essential to its well-being. The problem was fixed, but much of the weave was damaged and unusually large tears between this plane and the feywild were opened. To hazard a guess, you fell through one of those. I am sorry to say I do not quite know how your form may be been changed, and that there is, at the moment, no way for you to return.||","created_at":"2021-07-30T22:02:38.398000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870788506417520691","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Pandamaster_0","id":"292531828592738304","is_bot":0,"username":"pandamaster_1"},"author_id":"292531828592738304","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Rax seems heatbroken over this news","created_at":"2021-07-30T22:04:50.321000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870789059742662696","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
