{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Demetrius nods. ||I am sorry I cannot help. But you are not alone. Several individuals have experienced similar fates.|| He pauses for a moment, as if considering. ||In fact, most of us on the council that oversees the burrough are from the feywild originally, and are now trapped here.||","created_at":"2021-07-30T22:11:22.305000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870790703842738196","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
